id: pm-brief-changelog-lf
title: Preserve generated changelog bytes on Windows checkouts
description: Move the existing changelog attribute and checkout regression from PR #228 into a standalone change. A Windows-style Git checkout without the attribute changes the generated bytes and breaks changelog validation.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: changelog,ci
created_at: "2026-11-23T00:10:08.265Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-24T00:50:24.961Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: The real Git conversion regression fails without the LF attribute and passes with it.
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T22:32:11.651Z",codex-agent,Move the canonical LF attribute and real Git checkout regression to the standalone branch. Verify the new test detects the checkout-byte failure without the attribute.
  "2026-11-23T22:32:35.426Z",codex-agent,"The Windows-style Git checkout regression fails on the LF-byte assertion when only the changelog attribute is reverted. With the attribute restored, the checkout and identity tests pass."
  "2026-11-24T00:50:24.961Z","harness:claude-code","Review fix 2026-11-24 (CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOSzIO-c67IjPO): the checkout fixture strips Git's repository-location variables (git rev-parse --local-env-vars: GIT_DIR, GIT_WORK_TREE, GIT_INDEX_FILE, …), so a caller's repository, such as a hook's index, is never written. New regression: running the fixture with a caller repo's GIT_DIR, GIT_WORK_TREE and GIT_INDEX_FILE leaves that index byte-identical. Revert proof: without the stripping it fails (pass 0, fail 1). File: 2/2."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  .gitattributes,project
  test/changelog-line-endings.test.ts,project
tests[2]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/changelog-line-endings.test.ts,project,codex-agent,"2026-11-23T00:10:11.534Z",local_mutation,codex/closure-1122/chore/close-merged-items-2026-11-16
  node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/changelog-line-endings.test.ts test/identity-audit.test.ts,project,codex-agent,"2026-11-23T22:32:22.380Z",local_mutation,fix/changelog-lf-checkout
